# "Whenever you sacrifice a Clue" is any Clue sacrificed for any reason (CR 701.21), not only to its own ability: Krark-Clan
# Ironworks sacrificing the Clue gives Bot2 two poison counters. Sacrificing Mox Ruby, an artifact that is not a Clue, to the
# same cost gives none: Bot2 still has two.
# Turn 1 casts the Interrogators with Black Lotus and three Moxen (and investigates); turn 3 casts Krark-Clan Ironworks with
# all five Moxen, then sacrifices the Clue and Mox Ruby to it.

